# Cursor AI Rules & Engineering Guidelines

# Mirroring AGENT_INSTRUCTIONS.md:
# Refer to AGENT_INSTRUCTIONS.md for full context.

- MANDATORY: Whenever you add, update, or refactor any feature or page, you MUST update PROJECT_OVERVIEW.md immediately.
- Never modify or break existing backend queries, Firestore rules, API routes, or state stores.
- Technology Stack: Next.js 16 (App Router), React 19, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS v4, Framer Motion, Firebase, TanStack React Query, next-intl.
- Design System: Follow design tokens defined in DESIGN_SYSTEM.md and src/app/globals.css.
- RTL & i18n: Always test both English (LTR) and Arabic (RTL) compatibility using logical Tailwind utilities.
